Summary: Calculate p-values adjusted for multiple testing
Description: This command calculates adjusted p values that account fo
 r multiple testing.  It includes false discovery rate and family-wise
  error rate adjustments.  The input is a dataset of p values or a lis
 t of values given in the command.
